    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bisuzuguza ibigirwamana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beli irunama, Nebo irubama, ibishushanyo byazo babihekesha inyamaswa n'amatungo. Ibintu mwahekeshaga mukabirambagiza, noneho bihindutse imitwaro ivuna amatungo arushye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibyo bigirwamana birunama bikubamira hamwe, byananiwe kwiyaka imitwaro irushya, ndetse na byo ubwabyo byajyanywe ho iminyago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimunyumve mwa nzu ya Yakobo mwe, namwe abarokotse bo mu nzu ya Isirayeli mwese, abo nahetse mukiri mu nda, nkabaterura mukivuka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkabageza mu za bukuru, ndi We. Muzarinda imvi ziba uruyenzi nkibaheka, ni jye waremye, ni jye uzaheka. Ni koko nzaheka kandi nzajya nkiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwampwanya na nde twahwana, kandi mwanshushanya na nde twasa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basukanura izahabu mu mufuka, bagera ifeza mu minzani, bakagurira umucuzi akabibacuriramo ikigirwamana, bagaherako bakacyikubita imbere bakakiramya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bakagiheka ku bitugu bakakijyana bakagishinga mu kibanza cyacyo, kigahagarara aho bagishinze aho ntikizahishingura, nubwo umuntu agitakira ntikibasha kumusubiza cyangwa ngo kimukize ibyago agize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimwibuke ibyo mwerekane ubugabo bwanyu, mwongere mubyibwire mwa bacumura mwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwibuke ibyabanje kubaho kera, kuko ari jye Mana nta yindi ibaho. Ni jye Mana nta yindi duhwanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpera mu itangiriro nkavuga iherezo, mpera no mu bihe bya kera nkavuga ibitarakorwa nkavuga nti ‘Imigambi yanjye izakomera kandi ibyo nzashaka byose nzabikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzahamagara igisiga cy'amerwe kive iburasirazuba, ari cyo mugabo ufite imigambi yanjye uturuka mu gihugu cya kure. Narabivuze no kubisohoza nzabisohoza, narabigambiriye no kubikora nzabikora.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimunyumve mwa bafite imitima inangiwe mwe, bari kure yo gukiranuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigije hafi gukiranuka kwanjye ntikuzaba kure n'agakiza kanjye ntikazatinda, nzagashyira i Siyoni ku bwa Isirayeli, ari we cyubahiro cyanjye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
